             ideas were re-implemented as portable math in csidetect: (1) NBVI-
             style automatic subcarrier weighting (emphasise motion-responsive
             subcarriers via normalized per-subcarrier variance instead of a
             plain average); (2) Hampel outlier rejection on the motion stream;
             (3) fully passive operation — sensing off any AP's beacons with no
             association (T-REX `csi auto` + single-source MAC lock).

